From 88b1f73a91a15d1b0a0f699a3ac2fa248c717ec6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:23:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(providers): add server-side provider proxy
 (/api/providers complete)

Add /api/providers (list configured providers, non-secret) and
/api/providers/complete (server-held-key completion via lib/providers
router). UI routes completions through the server proxy when the server
reports configured providers; BYO-key remains the opt-in fallback.

- app/api/providers/route.ts (GET /api/providers)
- app/api/providers/complete/route.ts (POST /complete)
- app/api/providers/route.test.ts + complete/route.test.ts (input
  validation, failover, key redaction, no key leakage)
- minimalist-ui/src/App.tsx: load configured providers, route through
  /api/providers/complete, fall back to BYO-key/simulated

npx tsc --noEmit, npm test and npm run build pass.

Co-Authored-By: Cline <proxy@cline.dev>
